1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:06,893
Soomaaliya qorrax badan bay leedahay… haddaba waayo Soomaalida qurbaha ku nool u yeeshaan yaraanta Fiitamiin D?

2
00:00:06,993 --> 00:00:14,262
Marka qorraxdu maqaarka ku dhacdo, jirku wuxuu sameeyaa Fiitamiin D. Fiitamiin D wuxuu xoojiyaa lafaha iyo murqaha.

3
00:00:14,362 --> 00:00:19,567
Maqaarka madow wuxuu u baahan yahay qorrax ka badan si uu u sameeyo isla qaddarka Fiitamiin D.

4
00:00:19,667 --> 00:00:26,819
Dalal sida UK, Norway iyo Canada, oo Soomaali badani ku nool yihiin, qorraxdu way daciif tahay, gaar ahaan xilliga qabowga.

5
00:00:26,919 --> 00:00:31,855
Dharka jirka qariya iyo inaan gudaha joogno waxay sii yareeyaan qorraxda maqaarkeenna gaarta.

6
00:00:31,955 --> 00:00:37,639
Yaraanta Fiitamiin D waxay keeni kartaa daal, xanuun lafaha iyo murqaha ah, carruurtana lafo jilicsan.

7
00:00:37,739 --> 00:00:42,985
Waydii dhakhtarkaaga baaritaanka dhiigga iyo kiniinnada Fiitamiin D, gaar ahaan xilliga qabowga.

8
00:00:43,085 --> 00:00:48,437
Talo caafimaad maaha, la tasho dhakhtarkaaga. Maxaad rabtaa inaan sharaxo marka xigta?

9
00:00:48,537 --> 00:00:51,673
Like noo dhiib oo subscribe si aad wax badan u barato!
